  "instance_name": "racial_dehumanization",
  "label": "The process of dehumanizing people based on their race",
  "description": "Racial dehumanization is the process of dehumanizing people based on their race, often to justify violence or discrimination against them. In the meme, the implication that killing zombies (non-human entities) is not homicide is used to dehumanize people of color, thereby trivializing racial violence. This requires understanding of the concept of racial dehumanization and its role in promoting harmful ideologies.",
